{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPicker","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSChipPicker","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tag","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tag","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Controls"]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"single","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": used to select only one option within the others"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"multiple","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": used to select several options within the others"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each chip contains a “tag”, i.e. a supposed to be unique value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The picker will expose choosen values through this “tag”.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It has also some configuration elements which will override the one applied to nested ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSFilterChip","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Voice Over","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" will use several elements to describe the component.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The picker itself does no have any defined accessiiblity value, label or identifier ; it remains in the users hands to define which one will be used.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However if defined in the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPickerData","isActive":true},{"text":" the items inside the picker will have such accessibility identifiers.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Code samples","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Define the elements to display in filter chip using OUDSChipPickerData.","    enum Drink: String, CaseIterable {","        case virginHolyLava, ipaBeer, mineralWater","    }","","    var someDataToPopulate: [OUDSChipPickerData<Drink>] {","        [","            OUDSChipPickerData(tag: Drink.virginHolyLava,","                               layout: .textAndIcon(\"Virgin Holy Lava\", icon: Image(systemName: \"flame\")),","","            OUDSChipPickerData(tag: Dring.ipaBeer,","                               layout: .textAndIcon(\"IPA Beer\", icon: Image(systemName: \"dog.fill\")),","","            OUDSChipPickerData(tag: Drink.mineralWater,","                               layout: .textAndIcon(\"Mineral water\", icon: Image(systemName: \"waterbottle.fill\")),","        ]","    }","","    \/\/\/ Single selection case","","    \/\/ Prepare the selection, with a value previously selected","    \/\/ Use the data and the binding for the picker.","    @State var selection: Drink = .mineralWater","","    \/\/ Here the picker with title, selection and data","    OUDSChipPicker(title: \"Select a drink\", selection: $selection, chips: someDataToPopulate)","","    \/\/\/ Multiple selection case","","    \/\/ Prepare the selection, with a value previously selected","    \/\/ Use the data and the binding for the picker.","    @State var selections: [Drink] = [.mineralWater]","","    \/\/ Here the picker with title, selection and data","    OUDSChipPicker(title: \"Select a drink\", selections: $selections, chips: someDataToPopulate)"]},{"text":"Design documentation","type":"heading","anchor":"Design-documentation","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There is no online specification as this component is not an official OUDS one."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Theme rendering","type":"heading","anchor":"Theme-rendering","level":2},{"text":"Orange","type":"heading","anchor":"Orange","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_chipPicker_Orange"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Orange Business Tools","anchor":"Orange-Business-Tools","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_chipPicker_OrangeBusinessTools","type":"image"}]},{"anchor":"Sosh","level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Sosh"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_chipPicker_Sosh","type":"image"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Wireframe","anchor":"Wireframe","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_chipPicker_Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0.17.0"}]}],"name":"Since"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"OUDSChipPicker","platforms":[{"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents14OUDSChipPick